  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under AR-C 80.21-.24 (SSARS), when the accountant becomes aware of a known misstatement in compiled financial statements and management fails to provide an adequate response, the accountant should consider whether modification of the report is sufficient or whether withdrawal from the engagement is necessary. This is the accountant''s primary recourse when management is uncooperative.
