  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under AT-C 305.07, financial forecasts are appropriate for general use because they present the entity''s expected financial results based on the responsible party''s assumptions about conditions expected to exist and courses of action expected to be taken. General use means distribution to parties not negotiating directly with the responsible party.
